[[2047,16,1,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npins 10 and 16 of connector A directly from the battery. (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) via fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nthis supply is used by the check device for the exterior lights.</p><p>The rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               also receives\na supply controlled by the ignition (INT) at pin 15 of connector\nB from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nbox \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . Pin 14 of connector B is earthed.</p><p>The engine rpm signal, which is different\nfor each engine type, comes from the engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to\npin 6 of connector B.</p><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure is signalled\nat pin 5 of connector B of module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               by the earth signal\ncoming from sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams relating to the components to which they refer.</p>"]]